From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marko Saukko <marko.saukko@jolla.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:48:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add missing network codes of known operators. JB#66116

Add MCC/MNC pairs that the Android apns-conf.xml of a recent MediaTek
device lists for an operator we already have, when LineageOS or the
AOSP sample apns-full-conf.xml confirms the internet access point, the
operator name matches the provider or its GSMA TS.25 name, and the
provider already lists that access point. SIMs of these networks were
not provisioned at all before.
